1794:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  InputTrigger the Internal trigger corresponding to the Timer Interfacing with the Hall 
1795:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
1796:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR0: Internal trigger 0 selected
1797:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR1: Internal trigger 1 selected
1798:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR2: Internal trigger 2 selected
