1801:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  CommutationSource the Commutation Event source
1802:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
