1897:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** /**
1898:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TIM commutation event sequence with DMA.
1899:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @note  This function is mandatory to use the commutation event in order to
1900:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        update the configuration at each commutation detection on the TRGI input of the Timer,
1901:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the typical use of this feature is with the use of another Timer(interface Timer)
1902:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        configured in Hall sensor interface, this interface Timer will generate the
1903:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        commutation at its TRGO output (connected to Timer used in this function) each time
1904:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the TI1 of the Interface Timer detect a commutation at its input TI1.
1905:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @note  The user should configure the DMA in his own software, in This function only the COMDE b
1906:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  htim TIM handle
1907:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  InputTrigger the Internal trigger corresponding to the Timer Interfacing with the Hall 
1908:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
1909:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR0: Internal trigger 0 selected
1910:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR1: Internal trigger 1 selected
1911:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR2: Internal trigger 2 selected
1912:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_ITR3: Internal trigger 3 selected
1913:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_NONE: No trigger is needed
1914:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  CommutationSource the Commutation Event source
1915:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
1916:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_COMMUTATION_TRGI: Commutation source is the TRGI of the Interface Timer
1917:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_COMMUTATION_SOFTWARE:  Commutation source is set by software using the COMG
1918:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL status
1919:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   */
