2388:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @brief  Group channel 5 and channel 1, 2 or 3
2389:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  htim TIM handle.
2390:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  Channels specifies the reference signal(s) the OC5REF is combined with.
